    "text": "dailyeasternnews.com\nwebsite\nCharleston\nEvents in Charleston this week\nBy Tiktok,1 days ago\nFourth of July is packed full with events in Charleston, and the surrounding days will offer festive activities as well. Red, White and Blue Days (Thursday – Friday) Charleston’s Red, White and Blue Days, which kicked off June 28, will continue at Morton Park with food vendors opening at 3 p.m. on Thursday. A free concert will follow, with Rockland Road performing at 7 p.m. and music legend Exile taking the stage at 8 p.m. Visitors are encouraged to bring lawn chairs or blankets.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
